# Which OAuth providers this deployment offers, comma separated. Empty or
# absent means email codes only, which is the one way in that needs nothing
# registered anywhere.
#
# Naming a provider here only draws its button. Each one also needs an app
# registered with the provider and its client id and secret pasted into
# Supabase under Authentication -> Providers:
#
#   github   a GitHub OAuth App, free, two minutes, no cloud console
#   google   an OAuth client in Google Cloud Console, plus a consent screen
NEXT_PUBLIC_OAUTH_PROVIDERS=""
